From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Date: Thu, 16 Jul 2026 22:49:26 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] r25-1-0085: add fail-closed direct path dispatch

Extend the immutable command record with one exact direct-path flag, compiled and revalidated through a shared predicate. Bypass only generic object, transparency, and type dispatch for simple unclipped normal-blend paths while retaining PDFium visibility, clip reset, color, forced-color, path option, AGG raster, fallback, and cancellation semantics.

Raise bounded candidate scratch from 256K to 1M commands so dense zoom tiles can reach the executor without unbounded memory. Keep text and paths with clips, patterns, transfer functions, soft masks, or non-normal blend on canonical RenderSingleObject.
